# Its id leads with aspect-: a State of the same name (Raging, Mindful, God Ki) has the bare one.
id: aspect-beyond
name: Beyond
polarity: positive
# number: its script is the whole of it. moment: entering, leaving, the start of a turn (stages 4-5).
# rule: how a Transformation is entered, left or Mastered - asked by transformations.mjs aspectLevel.
group: rule
# The rule in short, for its hovers; its own words below (the page the user gave, 2026-11-20).
summary: >
  Cannot be used with stacks of Holding Back, unless Fully Mastered.
text: >
  Beyond: This Transformation pushes your body beyond its ordinary limits.
  –Effect: This Transformation cannot be used while you have any stacks of Holding Back, unless you have Fully Mastered the Transformation.

---

# Said as it is entered: not with Holding Back stacks unless Fully Mastered (transformations.mjs aspectWarnings).
